    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 3 Abbey Terrace is a well-presented three-bedroom home ideally located in the heart of Kildare Town, offering bright and practical accommodation within walking distance of a wide range of amenities and transport links.\r\n\r\nThe property is exceptionally well positioned, just a one-minute walk from Tesco, two minutes from Kildare Town Centre and only 2 minutes from the renowned Kildare Village Shopping Outlet. For commuters, Kildare Train Station is approximately a 10-minute walk away, while the M7 motorway is easily accessible, providing excellent connectivity to Dublin and beyond.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall with guest WC, a spacious front-facing sitting room with feature fireplace and a fully fitted kitchen/dining area with integrated appliances. To the rear, a bright sunroom with glass ceiling provides additional living space and opens directly onto the enclosed rear garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three bedrooms, all benefiting from built-in wardrobes, together with a fully tiled family bathroom.\r\n\r\nOutside, the rear garden is fully enclosed and laid in lawn with a footpath leading to a built-in garden shed, providing valuable outdoor storage space.\r\n\r\nSituated in one of Kildare Town's most convenient residential locations, No. 3 Abbey Terrace is ideally suited to first-time buyers, investors and those seeking a home within walking distance of all local amenities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\n 5.3m x 2.0m\r\n Welcoming entrance hall with tiled flooring, carpeted stairs, radiator and access to guest WC.\r\n\r\nGuest WC\r\n 1.9m x 0.8m\r\n Comprising WC, wash hand basin, tiled flooring and extractor fan.\r\n\r\nSitting Room\r\n 4.4m x 3.08m\r\n Bright front-facing reception room with carpet flooring, feature fireplace and wall lighting. Opens into the kitchen/dining area.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\r\n 5.28m x 3.5m\r\n Fully fitted kitchen with tiled flooring, tiled splashback, integrated dishwasher, integrated fridge/freezer and plumbing for washing machine. Spacious dining area with access to the sunroom.\r\n\r\nSun Room\r\n 2.9m x 3.0m\r\n Bright additional living space featuring laminate flooring, glass ceiling and double doors opening onto the rear garden.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nLanding\r\n 3.3m x 2.2m\r\n Carpet flooring and hot press.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\n 2.27m x 2.2m\r\n Fully tiled bathroom comprising bath with electric shower, WC, wash hand basin and radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n 3.5m x 3.0m\r\n Rear-facing bedroom with carpet flooring and built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n 4.6m x 3.2m\r\n Spacious front-facing double bedroom with carpet flooring and built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n 2.1m x 2.0m\r\n Front-facing bedroom with carpet flooring and built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\n\r\nRear Garden\r\n 11m x 5.4m\r\n Fully enclosed north-facing garden laid in lawn with footpath leading to a built-in garden shed.\r\n\r\nGarden Shed\r\n 2.47m x 2.1m\r\n Built-in storage shed providing excellent outdoor storage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- 3 Bed Mid-Terrace\r\n- Off street parking\r\n- Floor area approximately 89 sq.m\r\n- Highly convenient town centre location\r\n- 1 minute walk to Tesco, 2 minute walk to Kildare Town Centre, 2 minute walk to Kildare Village\r\n- 10 minute walk to Kildare Train Station\r\n- Direct access to the M7 motorway\r\n- Bright sunroom overlooking rear garden\r\n- Built-in wardrobes in all bedrooms\r\n- Built in 2002\r\n- Gas fired central heating"
      },
      {
